# People

Curated entity notes for individuals Nick is actively working with or has material context on. One file per person, kebab-case slug from full name (`first-last.md`).

**Frontmatter contract:**
```yaml
title: Full name
type: person
domain: surf-lifesaving | career | consulting | personal | accessbuddy | ...
organisation: Primary org (if relevant)
role: Current role / title
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD
related:
  - "[[note-slug]]"
```

**What belongs here:** people Nick is in active correspondence with, key stakeholders on his projects, named referees, recurring counterparts on the lifesaving/consulting/career fronts. Not casual acquaintances; not historical context with no live thread.

**Update cadence:** when role changes, when status of the working relationship shifts (active → dormant), or when a new material fact surfaces (relocation, change of channel, conflict, decision).

**Cross-links:** wikilink to relevant project notes in workspace, to Companies notes for their employer, and to other People notes for relationship pairs (e.g. reports-to, peer-of).
